  "transcript": "Hi, I am Harshit Shah. I am currently studying CSE, IIML. I consider myself to have a lot of different skills and qualities that might be useful. One of them being that I am an extremely good team player. I have a lot of different management skills. I love stepping up and taking the initiative to things. That is basically ingrained in my personality. If I know that something needs to happen, I just feel like it needs to be me that makes it happen with the help of my entire team. Apart from that, a very good example of that is that I am the chairperson of ACM, which is the largest technical college club on campus, and I had over 220 members in my team itself. Apart from that, I have had a couple of internships. One as a process analyst at JSW State. Another one as an intern with Slick, where my direct contributions resulted in over...",
